{
  // Characters, by what they are.
  //
  // Allies carry a Class, a SignatureId and a SignatureAffinity. The class provides the basic
  // ability every character of it has; the signature is what makes this Warrior different from
  // that one, and the affinity is what the signature is made of - its damage type and therefore
  // its status effect. The kit is derived from the three, so an ally lists no abilities of its
  // own. Signatures live in SignatureData.json. Design doc 05 §1.
  //
  // Enemies and bosses still list their own abilities: nothing rolls them, so they need no
  // signature.
  //
  // Health is the class's, and grows by HealthGrowthPerLevel a level (design doc 03 §2b).
